<title>MALAYSIA: Perlis Plantations 6-mth net down.</title>
<headline>Perlis Plantations 6-mth net down.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		71.48	  vs	  102.89</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     19.42	  vs	   27.96</p>
<p>    Turnover	     2,803.45	vs	2,877.91</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 129.92	vs	  190.17</p>
<p>    Minorities		27.28	vs	   53.21</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries loss   0.96	vs  gain    7.36</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)     8.0	 vs	    8.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Perlis Plantations Bhd. The company's operations include flour milling, animal feed and edible oil refining.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
